			<div class="content" id="post-content-3811783">
									

<p>This is quite good. There are some really novel flourishes in this, like the way you connected this to AWCY? without the use of a signed note. I also appreciate the Conclusion/Discussion section of the test log; usually that kind of thing would be included in the description, but this placing makes sense and keeps your test log results from getting spoiled too early. I may have to steal that trick sometime.</p>
<p>The only suggestion I'd make it is to use bolding instead of italics in the test logs, since it gives the eye someplace to rest and creates a clearer hierarchy of information, but that's a small detail. Enthusiastic +1.</p>

